  "description": "Reid eMetro+ Folding eBike | 500W eBike\nThe Reid eMetro+ Folding eBike combines powerful electric assistance with a compact folding design, making it a practical option for urban travel and leisure riding. Its 20-inch wheels, ultra-low step-through frame and folding components offer convenient access and easier storage.\nPowered by an Ananda 48V 500W rear hub motor delivering 50Nm of torque, the eMetro+ provides responsive assistance for everyday journeys. A 48V 15Ah battery with a 720Wh capacity supports longer rides, while the thumb throttle offers on-demand power. The Key Display KD58C keeps essential ride information accessible at a glance.\nDesigned for comfort across varied surfaces, the eMetro+ features a Uding D9 suspension fork with 60mm of travel and wide 20 x 4.0-inch tyres for cushioning, grip and stability. Shimano 8-speed gearing, controlled by an SL-M315 shifter and paired with an M310 rear derailleur, provides flexibility across different riding conditions. Tektro HD-M275 hydraulic disc brakes deliver reliable stopping power at the front and rear.\nPractical finishing touches include an ergonomic comfort saddle, ergonomic lock-on grips, 620mm handlebars with a 20mm rise, an alloy folding stem and platform pedals. Together, these features create a comfortable riding position and make the eMetro+ easier to store when not in use.\nThe Reid eMetro+ Folding eBike is ideal for:\n\nUrban riders, with a compact folding design for convenient storage\n\nRiders seeking powerful assistance, with a 500W Ananda motor delivering 50Nm of torque\n\nLonger leisure rides, with a 720Wh battery\n\nRiders exploring varied surfaces, with a 60mm suspension fork and wide 20 x 4.0-inch tyres\n\nCyclists wanting versatile gearing, with an 8-speed Shimano drivetrain\n\nRiders prioritising braking control, with Tektro hydraulic disc brakes\n\nComfort-focused cyclists, with an ergonomic saddle, lock-on grips and raised handlebars",
